ents</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A soundtrack containing songs for each layer</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New collectable colors and hats for your Squid to wear!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cute NPCs you can chat with as you climb</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything hand drawn with a trackpad</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;Yes, my fellow Squinks will tremble as they watch me splatter and soar!&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0-Squink</p>",
